The ABC playback sound bank (the MP3 note samples under
assets/libs/abcjs/soundfont/) is taken from the FluidR3_GM collection published
by the midi-js-soundfonts project (https://github.com/paulrosen/midi-js-soundfonts),
which is also the source abcjs uses by default.

Only the General MIDI program 0 instrument (acoustic_grand_piano) is used.

The samples were generated from FluidR3_GM.sf2 by Frank Wen, released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported license (CC BY 3.0). Attribution to
Frank Wen must accompany any redistribution. The tooling in the
midi-js-soundfonts repository itself is MIT-licensed.

